  "description": "HUDHOF crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C114 H80 Er4 N8 O18 S4,7(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.551-3.812 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.84-111.34°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C114H80Er4N8O18S4·7(C7H8). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
